{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫（TVB）《娛樂新聞台》主播賴彥妤（Vivienna）憑藉甜美外貌與驕人身材，一直被不少網民封為「娛樂新聞台女神」。賴彥妤曾與男友於台灣自駕遊時不幸發生車禍，又不慎被路邊鐵馬壓傷右腿小脛骨留下12cm傷口。日前賴彥妤又出意外，她發文自爆下巴撞落石頭縫足8針，頗為黑仔。</p><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤又出意外。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251120/1068179608915939328905371.jpeg/6Mr8f5ABeyB-V3kvxRzKpMZd7DbRcxgennjdPJ543Tw\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤又出意外。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤畢業於英國高雲地利大學法律系碩士，有兩個碩士同深造文憑學位，參選時有「英國學霸」之稱。（IG：@vivianlai0824）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230306/709378271246028800701482.jpeg/_EhMv8dKekafXuHP5X5bdOZke8h4QWLs-NcKOvjXCjo\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤畢業於英國高雲地利大學法律系碩士，有兩個碩士同深造文憑學位，參選時有「英國學霸」之稱。（IG：@vivianlai0824）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤出席劇集宣傳活動。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167494366399303680124586.jpeg/zaJKfZAQWvrL7dEajhqqSXg1tBBBdgMETgHaAHQB2gA\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤出席劇集宣傳活動。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><p>賴彥妤下巴撞石頭縫8針</p><p>賴彥妤日前在限時動態分享照片，她下巴貼了一個膠布，連條頸和上衣都染有血跡，相當嚇人。雖然看似只撞到下巴傷勢不嚴重，但原來足足縫了8針。她透露原來做完運動不小心撞向石頭：「意外就係咁突然做完運動撞咗落舊石 咁就聯咗八針 仲要撞正最忙嘅11月出院繼續工作 多謝各位關心」。賴彥妤露出不開心的模樣。惟賴彥妤繼續開工，她上載一張開工相，發文：「工作繼續 要keep住個poker face 練習微表情」。</p><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤下巴撞向石頭縫了8針。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194347374810632192465180.jpeg/ncdaNDsO2hXM35hpIvbKWBy4TA8uqxLnCZQBQwmUAUM\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤下巴撞向石頭縫了8針。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤繼續開工。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194347372260364288206387.jpeg/ZdH8sy-gJ2GXjTAHipZCXP3wo213rdayGWMDUBljA1A\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤繼續開工。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤畢業於英國高雲地利大學法律系碩士。（IG：@vivianlai0824）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230306/709378273708216320059871.jpeg/1gJ3WNtUbFMEZmir45tREMr1y27FmU-ppPXjWKT141g\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤畢業於英國高雲地利大學法律系碩士。（IG：@vivianlai0824）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤努力keep靚身形。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220930/652605315090616320809427.jpeg/bdgJqW8dwycF9ANBzRnh5vA5OZdfejwICvgtwwr4LcM\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤努力keep靚身形。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤著上露臍西裝look 盡顯線條。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220930/652605317544415232013795.jpeg/eQyphoesTvfiiOQMl_lHO3VfTQTEdtJi0ZWUhdGVlIU\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤著上露臍西裝look 盡顯線條。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤身材好好。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220930/652605312326438912863912.jpeg/v1C7FLKJ1HEtnDcUW3422H-rZmghVaXOyHN2QshzdkI\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤身材好好。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤曾參選《2014中華才藝小姐（香港區）》、英國華裔小姐等，2020年曾參選港姐但落選收場，2021年捲土重來，奈何首輪已被淘汰無緣進入準決賽。（IG：@vivianlai0824）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220506/599233104285011968126098.jpeg/W9RjqP-PAMiM_czid9xTBcdwZ_2BvPPv7QN2iO0Ddog\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤曾參選《2014中華才藝小姐（香港區）》、英國華裔小姐等，2020年曾參選港姐但落選收場，2021年捲土重來，奈何首輪已被淘汰無緣進入準決賽。（IG：@vivianlai0824）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賴彥妤是娛樂台女神。（IG：@vivianlai0824）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220506/599233106801725440416352.jpeg/wJ3bEvc-KM9EuZqyeo1aJnHrpGmxV8BKEXul9BF7pfQ\"/><figcaption>賴彥妤是娛樂台女神。（IG：@vivianlai0824）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T22:41:47.693081+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":684,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T22:30:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T23:38:38.346113+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T22:39:28.979204+00:00","content_hash":"159a4c4a473283a96db36263eb4b5d9ec44718abcf6303a9a457573c2bf2d70a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}